    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: fed21b371093056efd22ac03ae0b3184568094f8 -->\r\n\r\nIndependent static review of the exact committed tree found no actionable corrections. The full moved `DeleteSetup` definition is unchanged after whitespace normalization, including refusal ordering/messages, owned furniture, and undo restoration; both public command paths remain available. The new regression establishes a generated linked-child operation, actual child placement movement with unchanged square stock, and the required stale / undo-fresh / redo-stale lifecycle.\r\n\r\nSeparate native Windows verification passed on that same tree: quick gate 870 passed / 0 failed / 8 ignored; all eight app setup suites passed (58 tests, overlapping quick coverage); app Clippy, new-module rustfmt and diff checks passed. Static review did not itself execute tests. Current-main merge preview and hosted mergeability are clean. No hosted checks are configured; this is not a hosted-CI pass or merge approval.\r\n",
